        <h1>LOTR Unleashed</h1>
        <p>One of my sisters is a huge <cite>Lord of the Rings</cite> nerd. (It&#8217;s not as bad as it used to be, though; you should have seen her room in high school.) I&#8217;m just a casual fan of the series. So, as a gag gift for Christmas, I recorded an audiobook of <cite>Fellowship</cite>&#8217;s first chapter. Preceding the book were a few goofy trailers, which elicited both chuckles and horrified looks. A success! Here&#8217;s one:</p>

